ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja455:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja455:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja455:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja455:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja455:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja455:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja455:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja455:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja455:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja455:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja455:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja455:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja455:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja455:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja455:13.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja455:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja455:0.2": "Ekādasakanipāta ", "ja455:0.3": "Mātuposakavagga ", "ja455:0.4": "1. Mātuposakajātaka ", "ja455:1.1": "“Tassa nāgassa vippavāsena, ", "ja455:1.2": "Virūḷhā sallakī ca kuṭajā ca; ", "ja455:1.3": "Kuruvindakaravīrā bhisasāmā ca, ", "ja455:1.4": "Nivāte pupphitā ca kaṇikārā. ", "ja455:2.1": "Kocideva suvaṇṇakāyurā, ", "ja455:2.2": "Nāgarājaṁ bharanti piṇḍena; ", "ja455:2.3": "Yattha rājā rājakumāro vā, ", "ja455:2.4": "Kavacamabhihessati achambhito”. ", "ja455:3.1": "“Gaṇhāhi nāga kabaḷaṁ, ", "ja455:3.2": "mā nāga kisako bhava; ", "ja455:3.3": "Bahūni rājakiccāni, ", "ja455:3.4": "tāni nāga karissasi”. ", "ja455:4.1": "“Sā nūnasā kapaṇikā, ", "ja455:4.2": "andhā apariṇāyikā; ", "ja455:4.3": "Khāṇuṁ pādena ghaṭṭeti, ", "ja455:4.4": "giriṁ caṇḍoraṇaṁ pati”. ", "ja455:5.1": "“Kā nu te sā mahānāga, ", "ja455:5.2": "andhā apariṇāyikā; ", "ja455:5.3": "Khāṇuṁ pādena ghaṭṭeti, ", "ja455:5.4": "giriṁ caṇḍoraṇaṁ pati”. ", "ja455:6.1": "“Mātā me sā mahārāja, ", "ja455:6.2": "andhā apariṇāyikā; ", "ja455:6.3": "Khāṇuṁ pādena ghaṭṭeti, ", "ja455:6.4": "giriṁ caṇḍoraṇaṁ pati”. ", "ja455:7.1": "“Muñcathetaṁ mahānāgaṁ, ", "ja455:7.2": "yoyaṁ bharati mātaraṁ; ", "ja455:7.3": "Sametu mātarā nāgo, ", "ja455:7.4": "saha sabbehi ñātibhi”. ", "ja455:8.1": "“Mutto ca bandhanā nāgo, ", "ja455:8.2": "muttamādāya kuñjaro; ", "ja455:8.3": "Muhuttaṁ assāsayitvā, ", "ja455:8.4": "agamā yena pabbato. ", "ja455:9.1": "Tato so naḷiniṁ gantvā, ", "ja455:9.2": "sītaṁ kuñjarasevitaṁ; ", "ja455:9.3": "Soṇḍāyūdakamāhatvā, ", "ja455:9.4": "mātaraṁ abhisiñcatha”. ", "ja455:10.1": "“Koyaṁ anariyo devo, ", "ja455:10.2": "akālenapi vassati; ", "ja455:10.3": "Gato me atrajo putto, ", "ja455:10.4": "yo mayhaṁ paricārako”. ", "ja455:11.1": "“Uṭṭhehi amma kiṁ sesi, ", "ja455:11.2": "āgato tyāhamatrajo; ", "ja455:11.3": "Muttomhi kāsirājena, ", "ja455:11.4": "vedehena yasassinā”. ", "ja455:12.1": "“Ciraṁ jīvatu so rājā, ", "ja455:12.2": "kāsīnaṁ raṭṭhavaḍḍhano; ", "ja455:12.3": "Yo me puttaṁ pamocesi, ", "ja455:12.4": "sadā vuddhāpacāyikan”ti. ", "ja455:13.1": "Mātuposakajātakaṁ paṭhamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja455:0.1": "", "ja455:0.2": "", "ja455:0.3": "", "ja455:0.4": "", "ja455:1.1": "", "ja455:1.2": "", "ja455:1.3": "Kuruvindakaravīrā → … karavarā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja455:1.4": "", "ja455:2.1": "", "ja455:2.2": "", "ja455:2.3": "", "ja455:2.4": "achambhito → asambhīto (bj, pts-vp-pli1); asambhito (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja455:3.1": "", "ja455:3.2": "", "ja455:3.3": "", "ja455:3.4": "tāni → yāni (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja455:4.1": "", "ja455:4.2": "", "ja455:4.3": "", "ja455:4.4": "", "ja455:5.1": "", "ja455:5.2": "", "ja455:5.3": "", "ja455:5.4": "", "ja455:6.1": "", "ja455:6.2": "", "ja455:6.3": "", "ja455:6.4": "", "ja455:7.1": "", "ja455:7.2": "", "ja455:7.3": "", "ja455:7.4": "", "ja455:8.1": "", "ja455:8.2": "muttamādāya kuñjaro → kāsirājena pesito (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed); mutto dāmāto kuñjaro (pts-vp-pli1, bj -nissya) ", "ja455:8.3": "assāsayitvā → vissamitvāna (bj); assasitvāna (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja455:8.4": "", "ja455:9.1": "naḷiniṁ → naliniṁ (bj); nilinaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja455:9.2": "", "ja455:9.3": "Soṇḍāyūdakamāhatvā → soṇḍāya udakamāhatvā (bj, pts-vp-pli1); soṇḍāya udakamāhitvā (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja455:9.4": "", "ja455:10.1": "", "ja455:10.2": "akālenapi vassati → akālena pavassati (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr); akālena'tivassati (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja455:10.3": "", "ja455:10.4": "", "ja455:11.1": "", "ja455:11.2": "", "ja455:11.3": "", "ja455:11.4": "", "ja455:12.1": "", "ja455:12.2": "", "ja455:12.3": "", "ja455:12.4": "", "ja455:13.1": "Mātuposakajātakaṁ → mātiposakajātakaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja455:0.1": "", "ja455:0.2": "", "ja455:0.3": "", "ja455:0.4": "", "ja455:1.1": "bj30.388, csp1ed22.226, csp2ed22.226, dr27.301, ms22J_2107, msdiv1, ndp22.218, pts-vp-pli4.92, sya27.303, vri68.178", "ja455:1.2": "", "ja455:1.3": "", "ja455:1.4": "", "ja455:2.1": "ms22J_2108, msdiv2", "ja455:2.2": "", "ja455:2.3": "", "ja455:2.4": "", "ja455:3.1": "ms22J_2109, msdiv3, pts-vp-pli4.93", "ja455:3.2": "", "ja455:3.3": "", "ja455:3.4": "", "ja455:4.1": "ms22J_2110, msdiv4", "ja455:4.2": "", "ja455:4.3": "", "ja455:4.4": "", "ja455:5.1": "ms22J_2111, msdiv5", "ja455:5.2": "", "ja455:5.3": "", "ja455:5.4": "", "ja455:6.1": "ms22J_2112, msdiv6", "ja455:6.2": "", "ja455:6.3": "", "ja455:6.4": "", "ja455:7.1": "dr27.302, ms22J_2113, msdiv7, sya27.304", "ja455:7.2": "", "ja455:7.3": "", "ja455:7.4": "", "ja455:8.1": "ms22J_2114, msdiv8, ndp22.219", "ja455:8.2": "", "ja455:8.3": "", "ja455:8.4": "", "ja455:9.1": "ms22J_2115, msdiv9, pts-vp-pli4.94", "ja455:9.2": "", "ja455:9.3": "", "ja455:9.4": "", "ja455:10.1": "csp1ed22.227, csp2ed22.227, ms22J_2116, msdiv10", "ja455:10.2": "", "ja455:10.3": "", "ja455:10.4": "", "ja455:11.1": "ms22J_2117, msdiv11", "ja455:11.2": "", "ja455:11.3": "", "ja455:11.4": "", "ja455:12.1": "ms22J_2118, msdiv12, vri68.179", "ja455:12.2": "", "ja455:12.3": "", "ja455:12.4": "", "ja455:13.1": "ms22J_2119"}, "keys_order": ["ja455:0.1", "ja455:0.2", "ja455:0.3", "ja455:0.4", "ja455:1.1", "ja455:1.2", 